  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">S1-67 Pamoja Cleantech AB entrepen&#xf6;rst&#xf6;d</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">S1-67 Pamoja Cleantech AB entrepreneurial support - B4D IAP S1-67 Pamoja Cleantech AB</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till IAP program innovationer. Det &#xf6;vergripande syftet med Pamoja Cleantech AB
projektet Green Plant skulle utveckla och implementera en f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningskedja f&#xf6;r biomassa p&#xe5; landsbygden i Uganda. Utfallsm&#xe5;len
inkludera f&#xf6;rberedelsearbete samt marknadstestning, utv&#xe4;rdering av aff&#xe4;rsmodeller och rapportering tillbaka till IAP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for innovatives business ideas under IAP programme. The overall purpose with Pamoja Cleantech AB
project Green Plant was to develop and implement a biomass supply chain in rural Uganda. The outcome objectives
include preparation work as well as market testing, business model evaluation and reporting back to IAP.</narrative>
  </description>
